    {
      "id": "control",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mesh & Control Gates\nDecision: Where does governed work enter, stop, progress, learn and convert value across the lifecycle?\nOwns: Lifecycle stage, transition criteria, gate result, STOP/HOLD and feedback route.\nExcludes: Element identity, Service definition, Method procedure, Benefit measure, Asset qualification decision or runtime authorisation.\nOpen HTML: [[00_SYSTEM/NAVIGATOR_SUPPORT/CURRENT/COMPONENTS/ELEMENT_MESH_CONTROL_GATES_v1.2.html]]\nReturn: [[00_HOME]]\nPPV: Potential | Authority: HELD for operational mutation | Replay: PRESERVED",
